const NO_TEXT='zero text, no words, no letters, no speech bubbles';
const COMMON_SCRIPT=`TOZA OVOZ QOIDASI: matn to'g'ridan-to'g'ri ovoz dasturiga (TTS) tushadi. Sarlavha, "NARRATOR:", "Story 1:", "[music]", "[pause]", "(sighs)", qavs ichidagi izoh, emoji, "[bleep]" yoki "f***" MUTLAQO yozilmaydi. Tovush va harakat faqat o'qiladigan gap ichida beriladi ("Suddenly, the heavy door slammed shut behind me.").
Gaplar qisqa-o'rtacha, ovoz chiqarib o'qishga qulay. Raqam va yillar TTS to'g'ri o'qiydigan shaklda yoziladi.
Barcha sana, ism, joy va raqamlar ishonchli manbaga tayanadi; tasdiqlanmagan ma'lumot yozilmaydi, to'qima raqam taqiqlanadi.`;
const COMMON_IMG=`Rules for every prompt:
- One prompt per frame line, about 35–50 words, showing exactly what THAT line says.
- CHARACTER PASSPORT: when a recurring character appears, copy their DNA description word for word in every prompt. Never write "the same character".
- SIMPLICITY: one clear action per frame, at most 1–2 simple props in the background.
- Never use the words: infographic, diagram, webcomic, educational, chart, label, poster, sign, text, numbers, detailed background (unless the formula itself contains them).
- Consecutive frames must change the shot: wide view / medium shot / close-up face / side view / low angle / top view.
- Violence, blood and death are shown symbolically, never graphic. Use neutral words (soldiers → men in uniform).`;

