  alt:{pct:20,when:'"u davrda yo\'q narsalar" (choy, pomidor, kartoshka), qadimgi xarita yoki obidalar',f:'Top-down 2.5D paper-craft diorama inside a warm wooden shadow-box frame, aged vintage parchment background. Hand-drawn 2D watercolor paper-cutout stickers with thick white die-cut borders and soft cast shadows showing [OBJECTS / MAP / LAYERED MADRASAH ARCHES]. Zero text, no words, no letters, no numbers, 16:9 --ar 16:9'},
